WEBVTT

00:00:59.514 --> 00:01:01.047
they are all important.

00:01:01.839 --> 00:01:05.847
But nothing changes
without one key ingredient.

00:01:06.339 --> 00:01:07.489
Motivation.

00:01:09.157 --> 00:01:11.450
But motivation is a tricky thing.

00:01:11.474 --> 00:01:17.807
If you've led a team, raised a child
or tried to change a personal habit,

00:01:17.831 --> 00:01:20.898
you know that motivation
doesn't just appear.

00:01:21.665 --> 00:01:24.660
Something has to change to make you care.

00:01:25.859 --> 00:01:30.599
And if there's one thing
that all of us humans care about,